DNA wrapped around gyrase by nucleolytic and chemical probing of complexes of unique DNA sequences.</article-title><source>Cell</source><volume>23</volume><fpage>721</fpage><lpage>729</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6261954</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000301-Peng1"><label>32</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Peng</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Marians</surname><given-names>KJ</given-names></name></person-group><year>1995</year><article-title>The interaction of <italic>Escherichia coli</italic> topoisomerase IV with DNA.</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><volume>270</volume><fpage>25286</fpage><lpage>25290</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7559669</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000301-Daniels1"><label>33</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Daniels</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name><name><surname>Woo</surname><given-names>TT</given-names></name><name><surname>Luu</surname><given-names>KX</given-names></name><name><surname>Noll</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Clarke</surname><given-names>ND</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>DNA binding and nucleotide flipping by the human DNA repair protein AGT.</article-title><source>Nat Struct Mol Biol</source><volume>11</volume><fpage>714</fpage><lpage>720</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15221026</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000301-Shen1"><label>34</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shen</surname><given-names>LL</given-names></name><name><surname>Baranowski</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Pernet</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name></person-group><year>1989</year><article-title>Mechanism of inhibition of DNA gyrase by quinolone antibacterials: specificity and coopera